RESPONSE CATEGORY COLLAPSE
if fitting a mirt package model (unidimensional GRM IRT model) to data and not all response options chosen in calibration sample (e.g., 1, 2, 3 get some responses but never 0), the 'test' data has to be collapsed in the exact same way.

